  <item>
    <title>Episode 99: 在美国做创始人投资的中国女生是什么体验--采访Jasmine</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6579ae9a81f03663d4db6211</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6579ae9a81f03663d4db6211</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Dec 2023 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> intro</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 我们的相识和为什么想到做一期播客</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> Jasmine的中美澳学历和工作背景-如何进入到VC/创投/私募</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>从投资人角度会考察几个点，他们考察的关键点是什么？中美在投资方向上有哪些不同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a>对当下创业的人建议</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> SAAS模式解释，passive income</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a> 经济下行时候投资模式人的改变</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a>三年前认识的项目为什么到现在才投资？投资人的成功率会有多高？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a>刚需行业和现金流行业都有哪些，她现在做的项目和想吸引的人是哪些？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a>隐藏小福利</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 进入投资人行业有比较好的切入点嘛？她为什么决定不读MBA而去做投资？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a>她如何在异国他乡创造人际联系network?</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a>如何决定是否要读MBA或者继续深造</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">29:28</a> 投资人如何给自己设立一个止损点或者退出调整原则是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 具体投资的核心，就在这俩字</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>我们终于总结出来更核心的挑选人的原则是哪俩字，还有哪些red flag需要注意</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a>投资人怎么做尽调due diligence和如何避坑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">38:11</a>啥？投资可以从几千开始投？有没有小成本新手试炼区？如何找到值得投资的初创公司？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 真正的networking如何维系，Jasmine对自己的期望是什么？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a>如果对25岁的自己和类似年龄的女神说句话，她会说什么</span><br><span>50: 55 她最近在读的书是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>联系方式 小红书@Jasmine张愉在美国</span><br><span>邮箱</span><a href="mailto:hello@jasmineyuzhang.com"><span>hello@jasmineyuzhang.com</span></a><br><span>linkedin </span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasmineyuzhang/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasmineyuzhang/"><span>www.linkedin.com</span></a><br><span>podcast: mommy and money with Jasmine Yu Zhang</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/651f0b54a3b0404cbfab8bc7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/651f0b54a3b0404cbfab8bc7"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a><br><span>课程/职场/被动收入/财富自由相关请关注公众号 jobhuntingsolution</span><br><span>房产投资公号：美国首都地产</span><br><span>灵性启蒙公号/播客: HPR秘密星球</span><br><span>小红书号：Heather美国地产投资</span><br><span>Logo设计：小荻 </span><a href="mailto:xiaodilove2020@hotmail.com"><span>xiaodilove2020@hotmail.com</span></a><br><span>音乐：The Right Direction by </span><a href="http://www.silvermansound.com" data-url="http://www.silvermansound.com"><span>www.silvermansound.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
